## Start

Create a docker network

```
docker network create kafka-network
```

```
docker compose up -d
docker compose down
```
## Connect

```
http://localhost:8083
```
## Setup

```
# add under advanced properties
request.timeout.ms=30000
default.api.timeout.ms=60000
```


